OL,3,GNEWSARare Suffragette Christmas card
OL,4,Afrom 1910 found at roadshow
OL,5,
OL,6,F"These weren't simply Christmas cards,
OL,7,Fthey were pieces of political
OL,8,Fcampaigning that helped fund one of the
OL,9,Fmost significant social movements in
OL,10,FBritish history," said Matt Case, an
OL,11,Fantiques specialist.
